1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Hello everyone, online and on-site

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Welcome to the live subtitling demo

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,000
This is a real-time subtitle operations system

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000
The desk supports pause, skip and manual delay

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Next we demonstrate a manual delay

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Viewer subtitles are shifted back two seconds

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:42,000
The screen is cleared temporarily for viewers

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Clearing ends and subtitles resume normally

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Every control syncs on the director clock

10
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000
That ends the demo. Thank you for watching
